    "en": {
      "trackName": "Bounce Buddies: Watch Game",
      "description": "Two buddies, one elastic connection, and a bouncy adventure!\n\nElastic Buddies is a fun platform adventure built around stretching, bouncing, and timing. Two buddies are connected together, and you’ll use their elastic movement to make your way across platforms and obstacles.\n\nMove your characters, build up the right amount of stretch, and use the rebound to reach the next platform. Good timing can turn a simple pull into the perfect jump.\n\nFeatures:\n\n• Simple and intuitive controls\n• Fun elastic and bouncing mechanics\n• Two-character cooperative gameplay\n• A variety of levels and obstacles\n• Play on iPhone and Apple Watch\n• Quick gameplay for anytime, anywhere\n\nMaster the bounce, find your rhythm, and help the buddies reach the finish!",
      "releaseNotes": "Enjoy one free play each day, with your allowance renewed the next day.\nUnlock unlimited play with a one-time purchase.\nRestore previous purchases from Settings or the unlock screen.\nSee your remaining daily free play on the home screen.",
