    },
    {
      "version": "1.3",
      "releaseNotes": "Added full-platform lava hazards for new buddy-climbing challenges.\nRefined level progression: lava stays visible in L2–L5. From L6 onward, it appears for 2 seconds and disappears for 3 seconds.\nAdded flowing lava effects, cooldown indicators, and advance warnings to help you time your jumps.\nImproved safe landing spots and obstacle placement. Jump guidance now appears only in the first level.",
      "seenAt": "2026-10-02T00:12:12Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "1.4",
      "releaseNotes": "Added volcanic rocks and lava-covered platforms for more challenging climbs.\nEarly volcanic hazards stay visible. Later levels introduce lava that appears for 2 seconds and disappears for 3—time your jumps carefully!\nRefined platform and obstacle layouts for more rewarding jumps and rope pulls.\nJump guides now appear only in L1. Take on the challenge without guides from L2 onward!",
      "seenAt": "2026-10-09T15:20:35Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "1.5",
      "releaseNotes": "Larger characters, platforms and obstacles make gameplay clearer on Apple Watch.\nA compact top bar displays your level and countdown together. Tap the timer to pause.\nAn adaptive layout gives you more room to play.\nImproved camera tracking keeps both buddies in view as you climb.",
      "seenAt": "2026-10-13T14:24:44Z"
    },
